"test": {"name": "live-fire-playthrough", "kind": "rules", "opponent": "Human", "rounds": "40", "rules": "standard", "check": "scriptLiveFire", "question": "Act 1, mission 4 (Resources/Campaign/Scenarios/1.4 Live Fire.dat), played with the player's clicks: three sides, the range's guns a bystander (no turns, never fought: nobody can attack them, they attack nobody); the salute and Gena's artillery lines; on Jori's first turn three bandits on the player's flank; the player's next turn: the range's gun A given, marked, the bandit in its range marked once it is selected, the attack previewed ('Enemy sighted!'), fired: the bandit suppressed, Gena's lines; the turn over: Anna's 'more cannons', Jori's squad sent for gun C, which joins him when it gets next to it; a unit of ours next to gun B: it joins us; the battle to the end: the player wins."}
}
